<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mylan Lab raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mylan Lab raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded Mylan Laboratories Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said sees sales in the generic drug market possibly doubling to $14 billion from $7 billion by 2002.</p>
<p>-- said sees a &quot;much improved&quot; business and new product outlook for the industry and for Mylan.</p>
<p>-- said believes &quot;earnings should show stronger positive gains.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Mylan gained 4/16 to 16-15/16.</p>
</text>
